# Curated model outputs are raw copies from Cube Voyager; their checksums in
# run_metadata.json are computed against the exact bytes at copy time. Treat
# them as binary so git never rewrites line endings on commit/checkout --
# autocrlf normalization was silently corrupting checksum verification in CI
# (Linux runner sees LF, Windows workstations see CRLF-reconstituted content).
runs/**/outputs/** -text
